  "goodToKnow": "Das Direktmandat is a constituency seat in the Bundestag, won with the most Erststimmen (first votes) in a Wahlkreis. The Zweitstimme decides party strength. Since the 2023 electoral reform, a constituency winner only gets the seat if covered by the party's Zweitstimmen share. Das Mandat means mandate or seat. Plural: die Direktmandate."
